[thin] Specified crown: the head is 6.7 mm on the seating plane, and the channel through it is the cutoff case's own 4.2 mm diameter. That leaves this 2.5 mm crown over the case, which presses its outboard generatrix (fuse-clamp/README.md, What holds the case).
alternatives: A taller head stands further into the bay over the flank. A shallower channel puts clamp material between the cover and the case and loses the direct pinch.
